			"notes": "## 0.2.3\n\n- Pots now sit flush on hot kitchen surfaces on Forge 1.20.1, fixing the floating-pot gap.\n- Fixed a crash when using Farmer's Delight baskets with Create: Central Kitchen on Forge.\n- Fridge ice upgrades now supply snowballs to cooking recipes correctly, without using up real snowballs from storage.\n- Better compatibility with optional cooking mods and supported Cooking for Blockheads versions.\n- Cookware on connected stoves is detected more reliably, and serving containers (bowls, etc.) are counted correctly."
		},
